image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/seyivibezmusic\\/dedbb424fa.webp\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/seyivibezmusic\\/dedbb424fa.webp\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"url_slug\":\"seyivibezmusic\",\"label\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@seyivibezvevo908\",\"created\":\"1558334348\",\"image_banner\":\"\",\"google_id\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Seyi Vibez (born Balogun Afolabi Oluwaloseyi, July 12, 2000, in Ketu, Lagos) is a Nigerian singer and songwriter working across street-hop, Afro-Fuji, and melodic Afrobeats. He began releasing music independently in 2019 with the single \\\"Anybody\\\" and built his profile through self-released projects without label backing. His debut album No Seyi No Vibez arrived in 2021, followed by Billion Dollar Baby in 2022, which peaked at No. 1 on Nigeria's TurnTable 50 Albums chart. The album's breakout single \\\"Chance (Na Ham)\\\" debuted at No. 19 on the UK Afrobeats chart. Additional albums include Vibe Till Thy Kingdom Come, Thy Kingdom Come (2023), and Fuji Moto. He won Best Street-Hop Artiste at the 16th Headies Awards in 2023. By year-end 2025, he ranked as the most-streamed artist on Audiomack. He operates as an independent artist with distribution through EMPIRE.\",\"instagram\":\"seyi_vibez\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"twitter\":\"seyi_vibez\",\"follow\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"no\",\"video_ads\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"updated\":\"1781798707\",\"name\":\"Seyi Vibez\",\"url\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagoslagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"tiktok\":\"\",\"instagram_id\":\"17841402930969293\",\"label_owner\":false,\"status\":\"active\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":9569565,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":2798712640,\"plays\":\"2,799M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/seyivibezmusic\\/dedbb424fa.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"12058975\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"12058975\",\"video_ads\":\"no\",\"updated\":\"1793728331\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/asakemusic\\/4e36c856bc.webp\",\"twitter\":\"asakemusik\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"url\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"tiktok\":\"\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"url_slug\":\"asakemusic\",\"label\":\"\",\"name\":\"Asake\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/asakemusic\\/4e36c856bc.webp\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"mrmoney\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"twitter_id\":\"\",\"created\":\"1563720008\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/asakemusic\\/\",\"status\":\"active\",\"follow\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Asake (born Ahmed Ololade, January 13, 1995, in Lagos) is a Nigerian singer, rapper, and songwriter. He studied Theatre and Dramatic Arts at Obafemi Awolowo University and began his career as a backup singer before gaining traction through social media freestyles. His 2020 single \\\"Lady\\\" opened the door; signing with Olamide's YBNL Nation in 2022 followed. His debut album Mr. Money with the Vibe (2022) debuted at No. 66 on the Billboard 200 and broke streaming records on release. Two more albums followed: Work of Art (2023) and Lungu Boy (2024), each debuting at No. 1 in Nigeria. He sold out London's O2 Arena in 2023 and New York's Barclays Center the same year. In February 2025, he departed YBNL and launched his own imprint, Giran Republic. His sound draws from Afrobeats, Fuji, amapiano, and Yoruba street music, delivered primarily in Yoruba and Pidgin English.\",\"google_id\":\"\",\"label_owner\":false,\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@ASAKEMUSIC\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/asakemusic\\/615f682c6b.webp\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":true,\"followers_count\":9265806,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":2799799318,\"plays\":\"2,800M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/asakemusic\\/4e36c856bc.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"16868865\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"16868865\",\"fb_id\":\"330899868678239\",\"bio\":\"Kidd Carder, popularly known as \\\"More Than a Kidd\\\", is a prodigy in the music world. Hailing from Nigeria, this 18-year-old award-winning musician has already made a significant impact on the industry with his brilliant collaborations and unique sound. His talents don't stop at performing, he's also a gifted songwriter, penning lyrics that resonate with audiences worldwide. His magnetic personality extends beyond music, making him a beloved media personality. Despite his young age, Kidd Carder has proven he's more than just a kid, he's a force to be reckoned with in the music industry. His journey is just beginning, and the world is eagerly watching to see what he does next.\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"created\":\"1576544465\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagoslagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"follow\":\"\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kiddcarder\\/f793085dae.webp\",\"name\":\"Kidd Carder\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"instagram_id\":\"4027575237330428\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/kidd.carder.39\",\"status\":\"active\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kiddcarder\\/3bef00fd72.webp\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"google_id\":\"111291112850570244309\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kiddcarder\\/3bef00fd72.webp\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"label_owner\":false,\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"twitter_id\":\"1199986332929540096\",\"label\":\"Throne Records \\/ ONErpm\",\"instagram\":\"\",\"url_slug\":\"kiddcarder\",\"url\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCHNe6URqImentui_kwiwzWg\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@kiddcarder\",\"twitter\":\"Kiddcarder1\",\"updated\":\"1782932402\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":true,\"followers_count\":209937,\"following_count\":1,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":52105521,\"plays\":\"52.1M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kiddcarder\\/3bef00fd72.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"20123133\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"20123133\",\"twitter_id\":\"\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/olamide\\/dc3862ddd8.webp\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/profile.php?id=100044445279110\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/olamide\\/dc3862ddd8.webp\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"url_slug\":\"olamide\",\"label\":\"YBNL Nation \\/ EMPIRE\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@OlamideBaddosneh\",\"created\":\"1581269307\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/olamide\\/036e2e4c63.webp\",\"google_id\":\"105176460483990494606\",\"bio\":\"Revolutionizing the soundscape of West African urban music from Bariga, Lagos, rapper, singer, songwriter, and record executive Olamide (Olamide Gbenga Adedeji) stands as an absolute titan and one of the most prolific, influential figures in Afrobeats history. Affectionately known as \\\"Baddo\\\" or \\\"King of Indigenous Rap,\\\" he first disrupted the mainstream with his 2011 debut album Rapsodi, setting the stage for a historic run of culture-shifting, back-to-back masterpieces including YBNL (2012), Baddest Guy Ever Liveth (2013), and the seminal Carpe Diem (2020). As the visionary founder of the powerhouse imprint YBNL Nation, he has earned unmatched industry reverence for his peerless track record as a kingmaker, discovering and launching the global careers of definitive modern superstars like Adekunle Gold, Fireboy DML, and Asake. Moving fluidly between gritty Yoruba-infused street rap and infectious, international Afropop, he achieved further critical milestones with his eleventh studio album, the self-titled, star-studded Olamid\\u00e9 (2025)\\u2014anchored by massive hits like \\\"Kai!\\\" featuring Wizkid and \\\"99\\\"\\u2014and his 2026 solo chart-topper \\\"Rock Me Gentle,\\\" cementing his enduring legacy as a premier godfather of the global African music explosion.\",\"instagram\":\"Olamide\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"twitter\":\"Olamide\",\"follow\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"authenticated_status\":\"\",\"video_ads\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"updated\":\"1792430945\",\"name\":\"Olamide\",\"url\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@olamide\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"label_owner\":false,\"status\":\"active\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":5620927,\"following_count\":1,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":1249661451,\"plays\":\"1,250M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/olamide\\/dc3862ddd8.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"11979764\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"11979764\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCv2Af9Bj3qYvyWBHzLBrCnQ\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/folapondis\\/2ec4a3befb.webp\",\"twitter_id\":\"1174664280848904192\",\"bio\":\"Born in 2001, Folarin \\u201cFOLA\\u201d Odunlami is a Lagos-based singer-songwriter whose soulful fusion of African rhythms and R&B elements defines a bold new wave in Afro-R&B. After earning acclaim with his debut EP what a feeling and a string of charting singles, FOLA has quickly emerged as one of Nigeria\\u2019s most introspective and emotionally resonant artists. His debut album catharsis solidifies him as a voice for a generation, uniting authenticity, vulnerability, and innovation in a way that resonates far beyond Nigeria\\u2019s borders.\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"label\":\"FOLA\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"name\":\"FOLA\",\"status\":\"active\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/folapondis\\/f2108abca5.webp\",\"apple_id\":\"001358.ba740b93ef464c1a9c08d9bf6bada7a1.0942\",\"google_id\":\"\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagoslagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"url_slug\":\"folapondis\",\"created\":\"1563374896\",\"twitter\":\"Folapondis\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/folapondis\\/2ec4a3befb.webp\",\"instagram_id\":\"17841406048620553\",\"label_manage\":false,\"tiktok\":\"http:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@folapondis__\",\"url\":\"\",\"label_owner\":true,\"updated\":\"1792763803\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":3166931,\"following_count\":6,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":685051260,\"plays\":\"685M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/folapondis\\/2ec4a3befb.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"11175803\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"11175803\",\"updated\":\"1788550559\",\"twitter\":\"kwekusmoke_\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"twitter_id\":\"\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Carving out a fiercely independent and powerhouse lane from Accra, Ghana, rapper and songwriter Kweku Smoke (Paul Amankwah) has solidified his reputation as an elite titan of contemporary Ghanaian hip-hop and Asakaa (Ghanaian Drill). Originally encouraged by his family to pursue law, he redirected his path after studying at KNUST, officially bursting onto the mainstream in 2019 when rap legend Sarkodie championed him online and collaborated on the breakout hit \\\"Yedin.\\\" He steadily elevated his street credentials through acclaimed underground projects like Snoop Forever (2020) and PLAYMAN (2023). He reached a major milestone with his 10-track project Born In Hell (2024), which took the top spot on local charts within 24 hours of its release and later swept a triple win at the 2025 Telecel Ghana Music Awards (TGMA), including an Artiste of the Year nomination. Celebrated for his gritty storytelling, raw trap execution, and smooth Twi-infused flows, he garnered massive co-signs from international heavyweights like Davido and Blaqbonez before pushing his sonic evolution further with the release of his sixth studio album, Walk With Me (2025), which featured cross-cultural standouts like Vic Mensa.\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"label\":\"Scatter Der\",\"google_id\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"label_owner\":false,\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"created\":\"1559320825\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kweku-smoke\\/70afe5ed6b.webp\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@kwekusmoke\",\"keywords\":\"kwaku smoke, kewku smoke, kweku smok\",\"url\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"kwekusmoke_\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@kwekusmoke\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\",\"name\":\"Kweku Smoke\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kweku-smoke\\/70afe5ed6b.webp\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"url_slug\":\"kweku-smoke\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/kwekusmokeofficial\\/\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kweku-smoke\\/3810344bc8.webp\",\"video_ads\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":2547681,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":472892848,\"plays\":\"473M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kweku-smoke\\/70afe5ed6b.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"10080919\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"10080919\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"url_slug\":\"peruzzivibes\",\"status\":\"active\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"updated\":\"1760