"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/kofi-mole\\/2ea41ed995.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"14462866\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"14462866\",\"updated\":\"1787921981\",\"twitter\":\"Zinoleesky\",\"label_name\":\"Oniyide Azeez\",\"created\":\"1573057436\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/zinoleesky\\/430ccbcdca.webp\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UChIrS2dMwWHj3cWAUv8Tl8Q\",\"bio\":\"Harnessing the soulful, distinctive sounds of the Agege suburbs in Lagos, Nigeria, singer and songwriter Zinoleesky (Oniyide Azeez) has emerged as a premier pioneer of contemporary Street-pop and Afro-fusion. He first captured widespread attention in 2019 through a series of viral freestyle videos alongside close friend Lil Frosh, which quickly led to him signing with Naira Marley\\u2019s Marlian Music imprint. He achieved a major career milestone with his 2020 breakout smash single \\\"Ma Pariwo,\\\" which propelled him into pan-African stardom and set the stage for his highly acclaimed debut EP, Chrome (2020). He capitalized on this commercial momentum with a relentless string of chart-topping hits\\u2014including \\\"Kilofeshe,\\\" \\\"Loving You,\\\" and the multi-platinum single \\\"Personal\\\" from his sophomore EP, Grit & Lust (2022). Renowned for his unique, high-pitched vocal textures, intricate storytelling, and effortless blending of Amapiano logs with traditional Fuji melodies, he has amassed hundreds of millions of global streams and solidified his position as one of the most influential hitmakers of his generation.\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"instagram\":\"zinoleesky\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"label\":\"Marlian Music\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@zinoleesky3\",\"status\":\"active\",\"name\":\"Zinoleesky\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"url_slug\":\"zinoleesky\",\"label_owner\":true,\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/zinoleesky\\/8cfbfd6509.webp\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":6253445,\"following_count\":49,\"can_upload\":true,\"label_manage\":false,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":1094045565,\"plays\":\"1,094M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/zinoleesky\\/430ccbcdca.webp\",\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/zinoleesky\\/430ccbcdca.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"57654465\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"57654465\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"label_manage\":false,\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@hotkidfirevevo1459\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"instagram_id\":\"17841403930677271\",\"url_slug\":\"hotkiidfire\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/hotkiidfire\\/ecbb158174.webp\",\"updated\":\"1785144661\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"google_id\":\"112382194104901180336\",\"created\":\"1648240830\",\"follow\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"hotkeedfire\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/hotkiidfire\\/ecbb158174.webp\",\"name\":\"Hotkeed\",\"label\":\"INDEPENDENT\",\"bio\":\"Injecting raw grit and infectious energy into the modern Nigerian street-pop landscape, rapper, singer, and songwriter Hotkeed (often stylized as Hotkid) has established himself as one of the culture's most resilient and versatile rising voices. He first captured widespread mainstream attention in 2022 through his explosive, career-defining collaboration with celebrity dancer Poco Lee on the hit street anthem \\\"Otilo (Izz Gone).\\\" Building on that momentum, he seamlessly merged introspective trap lyricism with high-octane Afrobeats rhythms, navigating the industry independently and with key co-signs from legends like Olamide and Zlatan Ibile. He reached a major artistic milestone with the release of his acclaimed 2024\\u20132025 album Never Fold, a deeply personal project packed with hit singles like \\\"FIRE,\\\" \\\"Dear God,\\\" and \\\"Polanco\\\" featuring Lyta. Renowned for his razor-sharp delivery and an u\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@hotkeedfire\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"hotkeedfire\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"twitter_id\":\"1091857819500982273\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/hotkiidfire\\/402161e220.webp\",\"label_owner\":true,\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":733629,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":150231521,\"plays\":\"150M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/hotkiidfire\\/ecbb158174.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"13575238\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"13575238\",\"updated\":\"1782835481\",\"twitter\":\"blaqbonez\",\"label_name\":\"Chocolate City Limited\",\"created\":\"1569914485\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/blaqbonez\\/42036e5586.webp\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UC0iZ_gqCk22K0jWscf75lhg\",\"bio\":\"Igniting a bold new era from Lagos, Nigeria, rapper and singer Blaqbonez (Emeka Akumefule) has established himself as one of the most versatile and fiercely entertaining forces in modern African hip-hop. Signed to Chocolate City, he first disrupted the status quo with his critically acclaimed 2018 album Bad Boy Blaq, famously proclaiming himself the \\\"Best Rapper in Africa.\\\" He backed up the claim by seamlessly pivoting between hard-hitting bars and infectious Afro-dancehall rhythms on major commercial milestones like Sex Over Love (2021) and Young Preacher (2022). Widely celebrated for his brilliant, self-directed viral marketing campaigns, comedic persona, and standout releases like Emeka Must Shine, he has garnered hundreds of millions of streams and solidified his position as a premier cultural trendsetter across the continent.\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"instagram\":\"blaqbonez\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"label\":\"Chocolate City Music\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@blaqbonez\",\"google_id\":\"110133750884172290447\",\"status\":\"active\",\"name\":\"Blaqbonez\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"url_slug\":\"blaqbonez\",\"label_owner\":true,\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/blaqbonez\\/837dd0129f.webp\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":1106231,\"following_count\":2,\"can_upload\":true,\"label_manage\":false,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":197768029,\"plays\":\"198M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/blaqbonez\\/42036e5586.webp\",\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/blaqbonez\\/42036e5586.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"11596101\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"11596101\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"updated\":\"1780067348\",\"label_name\":\"Yve Digital Solutions Limited\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/fameyemusic\\/ad35a5636a.webp\",\"twitter\":\"fameye_music\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/music.apple.com\\/gh\\/album\\/traveler\\/1876108929?i=1876108930\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"tiktok\":\"\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"label\":\"Fameye worldwide\",\"url_slug\":\"fameyemusic\",\"name\":\"Fameye\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/fameyemusic\\/ad35a5636a.webp\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"fameye_music\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"label_manage\":false,\"twitter_id\":\"\",\"created\":\"1561454630\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/ebefameye\",\"status\":\"active\",\"follow\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Peter Famiyeh is a Ghanaian Hiplife Hilife Afropop musician popularly known on stage as FAMEYE and founder of music label Fameyeworldwide . Known for making spiritual ,moody & contemporary melodies with a soothing tone , had his Major breakthrough single titled NOTHING I GET in 2019.\\r\\nBorn in police hospital Cantoments Accra (Ghana) raised in Bogoso by his Grandmother after loosing both parents.\\r\\nAfter years in the music industry he believes he is yet to conquer the world in a unique form with his African language (Twi ) a popular Ghanaian language . Peter is a spirit   More of a messenger and a preacher his alter ego says!!\",\"google_id\":\"109507113706812173322\",\"label_owner\":true,\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCSWqfN3hLOlZwaKDBiD0mKw\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/fameyemusic\\/0b0fa56810.webp\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":2148431,\"following_count\":5,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":206668198,\"plays\":\"207M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/fameyemusic\\/ad35a5636a.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"3630738\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"3630738\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"label\":\"Shatta Movement Records\",\"label_owner\":true,\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/shattawalenima\\/6e9989ab53.webp\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/youtube.com\\/@Shattawalegh\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/ShattaWaleshattaMovement\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"name\":\"SHATTA WALE\",\"genre\":\"dancehall\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/shattawalenima\\/05e2a3f825.webp\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"ghanagreateraccra\",\"display\":\"Greater Accra, Ghana\"},\"hometown\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"shattawalegh\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@shattawaleking\",\"instagram\":\"shattawalenima\",\"status\":\"active\",\"url_slug\":\"shattawalenima\",\"created\":\"1499972116\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/shattawalenima\\/05e2a3f825.webp\",\"updated\":\"1790276815\",\"bio\":\"Pioneering a revolutionary movement from Accra, Ghana, dancehall and Afrobeats singer, songwriter, and producer Shatta Wale (Charles Nii Armah Mensah Jr.) stands as one of the most decorated, influential, and fiercely independent icons in modern African music. Originally rising to fame in 2004 under the moniker Bandana with the smash hit \\\"Moko Hoo,\\\" he engineered a historic career rebrand in 2013, bursting back into the spotlight as Shatta Wale with the culture-shifting anthem \\\"Dancehall King,\\\" which won him Artiste of the Year at the 2014 Ghana Music Awards. He achieved a monumental global milestone when international superstar Beyonc\\u00e9 tapped him for the hit single \\\"Already\\\" from her soundtrack album The Lion King: The Gift (2019), propelling him to worldwide prominence and earning him an RIAA gold certification. Renowned for his prolific output, passionate \\\"Shatta Movement\\\" fanbase, an\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":3768858,\"following_count\":3,\"can_upload\":true,\"label_manage\":false,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":801631457,\"plays\":\"802M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/shattawalenima\\/05e2a3f825.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"31592402\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"31592402\",\"label_owner\":true,\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/ayomaff\\/becaa485fb.webp\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/profile.php?id=100094351039829&mibextid=LQQJ4d\",\"url_slug\":\"ayomaff\",\"updated\":\"1794584369\",\"instagram\":\"ayomaff\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"name\":\"Ayo Maff\",\"follow\":\"\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@AyoMaff\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/music.empi.re\\/princeofthestreet\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"bio\":\"Ayo Maff is an artist from the Western part of Nigeria with a big dream to use his talent to announce himself to the world. Born Mafoluku Ayorinde Ayodele, his journey into the music scene came naturally to him being that it his biggest push and ambition. Ayo Maff is convinced that I\\u2019m due time he will carve his own niche and make a name for himself and his art.\",\"tiktok\":\"http:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@iam_ayomaff\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/ayomaff\\/1561b4dd9c.webp\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"label\":\"\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"instagram_id\":\"7182843351789542\",\"google_id\":\"115623357831379580627\",\"created\":\"1602778797\",\"label_manage\":false,\"status\":\"active\",\"twitter_id\":\"1519855445426548737\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagoslagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/ayomaff\\/1561b4dd9c.webp\",\"twitter\":\"AyoMaff\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":3650268,\"following_count\":56,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":576159147,\"plays\":\"576M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/ayomaff\\/1561b4dd9c.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"136354609\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"136354609\",\"updated\":\"1788772718\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"twitter_id\":\"\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Welcome to my Audiomack page! \\ud83c\\udfb5\\n\\nYour home for quality music, fresh vibes, and carefully selected playlists. Follow for consistent uploads and discover your next favorite sound.\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"verified\":\"authenticated-declined\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"label\":\"Naco Music\",\"google_id\":\"102831785079685394229\",\"status\":\"active\",\"label_owner\":false,\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigeriafederalcapitalterritoryabuja\",\"display\":\"Abuja, Nigeria\"},\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"created\":\"1725953484\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/elvischima4300\\/7cd6c1d051.webp\",\"youtube\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@elvis44524\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\",\"name\":\"Naco Boy\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/elvischima4300\\/7cd6c1d051.webp\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"url_slug\":\"elvischima4300\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/elvischima4300\\/618b1bd362.webp\",\"video_ads\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":43811,\"following_count\":5,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":24238427,\"plays\":\"24.2M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/elvischima4300\\/7cd6c1d051.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"52906245\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"52906245\",\"name\":\"Mickey Lux\",\"url_slug\":\"mickeyluxmusic\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/mickeyluxmusic\\/c0a3a270dd.webp\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/mickeyluxmusic\\/c0a3a270dd.webp\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/mickeyluxmusic\\/0083946aad.webp\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"bio\":\"I am the best thing to happen to African music.\",\"twitter\":\"MickeyLuxMusic\",\"facebook\":\"http:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/mickeyluxmusic\",\"tiktok\":\"http:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@mickeyluxmusic\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"twitter_id\":\"406393167\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"google_id\":\"102489433578289454548\",\"youtube\":\"\",\"label\":\"Luxirian\",\"url\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"updated\":\"1793733117\",\"created\":\"1640306175\",\"status\":\"active\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"label_owner\":true,\"label_manage\":false,\"follow\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"ghanagreateraccraaccra\",\"display\":\"Accra, Ghana\"},\"linktree\":\"\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":20415,\"following_count\":12,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":1365658,\"plays\":\"1.37M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/mickeyluxmusic\\/c0a3a270dd.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"10351181\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"10351181\",\"bio\":\"Afrorave prodigy, Rema was introduced to the world in March 2019, with the release of his self-titled debut EP, and the global hits \\u201cCorny\\u201d, \\u201cDumebi\\u201d and \\u201cIron Man\\u201d which was featured on Barack Obama\\u2019s Summer Playlist. His debut EP will be remembered for defining a new era for African pop. He\\u2019s released two more projects in the same year of his unveil.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe 23-year-old\\u2019s ascent to global recognition has inspired multiple mentions in global publications and platforms, including cover stories in Fader & Dazed, and features in Pitchfork and Rolling Stone which listed \\u201cIron Man\\u201d among its best 50 songs of 2019.\\r\\n\\r\\nRema continued his global mission in 2020 with the double release of the Rvssian-assisted \\u201cBeamer\\u201d and \\u201cRainbow\\u201d, and chart-topping \\u201cGinger Me\\u201d and \\u201cWoman\\u201d.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith the release of his debut Album, Rave and Roses in 2022, followed by a 14 cities sold out tour of the United States and a collaboration with Selena Gomez on his global hit, Calm Down Remix- Rema became the highest and longest charting Afrobeat artist on the Billboard Hot 100. He has also become the first ever artiste to record a billion Spotify streams on an Afrobeat record. With a Guinness World Record, over 2 Billion Career streams, a VMA Award for Best African Song, and a show at the 02 Arena billed for November, Rema\\u2019s music continues its stranglehold on streaming charts, and the singer's push for global stardom is stronger than it's ever been. In October 2023, he released a 5-track EP titled \\\"RAVAGE\\\"\\r\\n\\r\\nremabookings@gmail.com\",\"hometown\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\",\"created\":\"1554990825\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"follow\":\"\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/heisrema\\/edd1fc968a.webp\",\"name\":\"Rema\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"label_manage\":false,\"status\":\"active\",\"label_name\":\"Mavin Records\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/heisrema\\/a1beaa1bcf.webp\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/heisrema\\/a1beaa1bcf.webp\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"label_owner\":true,\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"label\":\"Mavin Records\",\"instagram\":\"heisrema\",\"url_slug\":\"heisrema\",\"keywords\":\"ream\",\"url\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCHGF6zfD2gwLuke95X3CKFQ\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@badboyrema\",\"twitter\":\"heisrema\",\"updated\":\"1760087677\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":6996208,\"following_count\":49,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":974291148,\"plays\":\"974M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/heisrema\\/a1beaa1bcf.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"9050372\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"9050372\",\"url\":\"\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wendyshay\\/e420fbbd21.webp\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/youtube.com\\/@wendyshayofficial?si=tmCu9ppkuNs3xdxK\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/Wendy-Shay-Official-237671470134252\\/?ref=bookmarks\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"name\":\"Wendy Shay\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"ghanagreateraccraaccra\",\"display\":\"Accra, Ghana\"},\"hometown\":\"Stuggart, Germany\",\"twitter\":\"wendyshaygh\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wendyshay\\/0f610f9bfc.webp\",\"updated\":\"1793810575\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"google_id\":\"101649895828591028595\",\"label\":\"RuffTown Records\",\"label_owner\":true,\"verified\":\"yes\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"label_manage\":false,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wendyshay\\/0f610f9bfc.webp\",\"follow\":\"\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@baddestwendyshay\",\"instagram\":\"wendyshayofficial\",\"status\":\"active\",\"url_slug\":\"wendyshay\",\"created\":\"1547736280\",\"bio\":\"Wendy Shay (Abena Addo) is a Ghanaian Afro-pop, Afrobeats, and Highlife singer and songwriter born in Accra, Ghana. Trained as a nurse in Germany before returning to Ghana to pursue music full-time, she signed with RoughTown Records in 2018 and quickly rose to prominence with her hit debut single \\\"Uber Driver.\\\" Named Best New Artist at the 2019 Vodafone Ghana Music Awards, she has consistently delivered chart-topping singles such as \\\"Emergency,\\\" \\\"Shay On You,\\\" and \\\"Survivor.\\\" Known for blending catchy pop melodies with empowering social commentary, she remains one of West Africa\\u2019s most influential female Afrobeats acts.\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":1549124,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":151556129,\"plays\":\"152M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wendyshay\\/0f610f9bfc.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"199929490\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"199929490\",\"updated\":\"1793378263\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"Nationn\",\"twitter_id\":\"\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Nationn, is a Nigerian singer, songwriter from Anambra state, Nigeria.\\nKnown After the success of his debut single\\n\\\"Available\\\" Nationn has successfully won the hearts of Afrobeat lovers and he doesn't look like slowing down anytime soon.\\nNationn merges his soothing voice and his unique melodies along with several electrifying stage performances which has stood him out as one to look out for in the afrobeat scene.\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"verified\":\"authenticated\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"label\":\"1BBFA\",\"google_id\":\"\",\"status\":\"active\",\"label_manage\":false,\"label_owner\":true,\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagoslagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/nationn1bbfa\\/3dbedda192.webp\",\"created\":\"1768148385\",\"youtube\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"nationn___\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@nationn___\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\",\"name\":\"Nationn\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/nationn1bbfa\\/3dbedda192.webp\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"url_slug\":\"nationn1bbfa\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/nationn1bbfa\\/491f031859.webp\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":1291,\"following_count\":1,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":228436,\"plays\":\"228K\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/nationn1bbfa\\/3dbedda192.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"13116975\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"13116975\",\"twitter_id\":\"\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wizkid\\/d7bb44b412.webp\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/wizkidmusic\\/\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wizkid\\/d7bb44b412.webp\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"hometown\":\"Surulere, Lagos, Nigeria\",\"url_slug\":\"wizkid\",\"label\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/user\\/WizkidVEVO\",\"created\":\"1568145186\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wizkid\\/7a2ae28037.webp\",\"google_id\":\"\",\"bio\":\"Wizkid (born Ayodeji Ibrahim Balogun, July 16, 1990, in Ojuelegba, Surulere, Lagos) is a Nigerian singer and songwriter who began recording at age 11 under the name Lil Prinz. He signed to Banky W's Empire Mates Entertainment in 2009 and released his debut album Superstar in 2011. His second album, Ayo (2014), produced \\\"Ojuelegba,\\\" later remixed by Drake and Skepta. His appearance on Drake's \\\"One Dance\\\" (2016) reached No. 1 in 15 countries. He signed to RCA\\/Sony International in 2017 and released Sounds from the Other Side. His fourth album Made in Lagos (2020) yielded \\\"Essence\\\" featuring Tems, the first Nigerian song to chart on the Billboard Hot 100. He won a GRAMMY Award for Best Music Video as a contributor to Beyonc\\u00e9's \\\"Brown Skin Girl\\\" (2021). Subsequent albums include More Love, Less Ego (2022) and Morayo (2024). A collaborative EP with Asake, REAL, Vol. 1, followed in January 2026. He operates his own imprint, Starboy Entertainment.\",\"instagram\":\"wizkidayo\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"twitter\":\"wizkidayo\",\"follow\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"video_ads\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"updated\":\"1781798975\",\"name\":\"Wizkid\",\"url\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@wizkidayo\",\"instagram_id\":\"\",\"label_owner\":false,\"status\":\"active\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":6164919,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":1139355821,\"plays\":\"1,139M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/wizkid\\/d7bb44b412.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"77612649\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"77612649\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCuv4b5gx6MpFAJJKgEwh1uw\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/tml_vibez\\/ba9c2ce05b.webp\",\"twitter_id\":\"1627978036053258242\",\"bio\":\"Injecting a fresh, melodic energy into Nigeria's thriving street-pop and Afrobeats landscape, rising singer-songwriter Tml Vibez (Timilehin Thompson) has quickly established himself as a voice to watch. He captured widespread industry attention after signing with Seyi Vibez\\u2019s independent powerhouse label, Vibez Inc, in late 2023. He immediately capitalized on the major platform by releasing his debut EP, Timileyin (2023), showcasing a natural gift for infectious hooks and heartfelt songwriting. Known for his smooth vocal delivery and ability to blend traditional Yoruba rhythms with modern street cadences, Tml Vibez became a mainstay on regional streaming charts through high-profile label collaborations, most notably on the Vibez Inc Mixtape Vol. 1 (2024). He further expanded his discography and cemented his status as a frontline solo artist with his sophomore EP, Wells Fargo (2024), followed by a steady run of impactful singles and collaborative projects.\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"hometown\":\"Nigeria\",\"follow\":\"\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"label\":\"Dapper Music & Ent\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"tml_vibez\",\"name\":\"Tml Vibez\",\"status\":\"active\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/tml_vibez\\/3b0131be3b.webp\",\"keywords\":\"tml vibes\",\"google_id\":\"117826115471173295685\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagoslagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"url_slug\":\"tml_vibez\",\"created\":\"1673353882\",\"twitter\":\"Tml_vibez\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/tml_vibez\\/ba9c2ce05b.webp\",\"instagram_id\":\"17841454895305465\",\"label_manage\":false,\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@tml_vibezboi\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"label_owner\":true,\"updated\":\"1781880824\",\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":2900932,\"following_count\":7,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":610481431,\"plays\":\"610M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/tml_vibez\\/ba9c2ce05b.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"26652855\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"26652855\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"follow\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/profile.php?id=100063988093963&mibextid=LQQJ4d\",\"name\":\"Miracle LRE\",\"tiktok\":\"\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"updated\":\"1788219789\",\"label\":\"Lazy Rich Entertainment\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"google_id\":\"116996608088613608431\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/MiracleLRE\\/6814c91b4e.webp\",\"url_slug\":\"miraclelre\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/MiracleLRE\\/2b75139164.webp\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"hometown\":\"Accra\",\"genre\":\"rap\",\"url\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"MiracleLRE\",\"label_owner\":true,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/MiracleLRE\\/2b75139164.webp\",\"status\":\"active\",\"twitter_id\":\"1230932749147680768\",\"label_manage\":false,\"bio\":\"Miracle is a rising Hip Hop, Drill, Trap, and Afrobeat artist from Ghana, who discovered his love for music at a young age. With a unique sound that blends different genres, Miracle is quickly becoming one of the biggest names in the music industry. His music is filled with raw emotions, deep reflections, and unstoppable beats that will leave an indelible mark on your heart. Keep an eye out for this rising star, who is destined for greatness.\",\"youtube\":\"\",\"created\":\"1593059154\",\"instagram_id\":\"4520678331286932\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"ghanagreateraccraaccra\",\"display\":\"Accra, Ghana\"},\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":199107,\"following_count\":1,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":15154614,\"plays\":\"15.2M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/MiracleLRE\\/2b75139164.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"9814057\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"9814057\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/bnxn\\/00471fcb4c.webp\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/Bujutoyourear\\/\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"linktree\":\"\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/bnxn\\/00471fcb4c.webp\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"url_slug\":\"bnxn\",\"label\":\"T.Y.E.\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCGCmhbMffOb80CIF8ACTfBA\",\"created\":\"1552445543\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/bnxn\\/cd14dd320b.webp\",\"google_id\":\"108863857976757121821\",\"instagram\":\"bnxn\",\"bio\":\"Originating from Lagos, Nigeria, singer-songwriter BNXN (Daniel Etiese Benson, formerly known as Buju) is a leading force in modern Afro-fusion, celebrated for his smooth vocals and undeniable presence in collaborations. He established a major presence on the UK Official Charts with massive guest features, including his work on Pheelz\\u2019s \\\"Finesse\\\" (2022)\\u2014which peaked at number 52\\u2014and JAE5\\u2019s \\\"Propeller\\\" (2022), which hit number 38. After laying a strong foundation with acclaimed projects like Bad Since '97 (2022) and his full-length debut Sincerely, Benson (2023), BNXN continued to impact the global soundscape with his sophomore studio album, Captain (2025), and his 2026 collaborative EP with producer Sarz, The Game Needs Us, anchored by the tracking single \\\"Already\\\" (2026).\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"follow\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"BNXN\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"yes\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"updated\":\"1781814808\",\"label_name\":\"Daniel Benson\",\"name\":\"Bnxn\",\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/www.bnxnlive.com\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"label_manage\":false,\"tiktok\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@bnxn_tye\",\"status\":\"active\",\"label_owner\":true,\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":3916223,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":997363392,\"plays\":\"997M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/bnxn\\/00471fcb4c.webp\"}}},{\"item_id\":\"17046270\",\"recommId\":\"42b97b61842ac190e1774f51bfcca940\",\"id\":\"17046270\",\"image_banner_processing\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/lasmidofficial1\",\"label_manage\":false,\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UC_Hf6Y-j6px_S7pngHcND0Q\",\"image_processing\":\"\",\"instagram_id\":\"17841408287747715\",\"url_slug\":\"lasmidofficial1\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/lasmidofficial1\\/5d071ce38d.webp\",\"updated\":\"1786033999\",\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"google_id\":\"112756788713910870315\",\"created\":\"1576782831\",\"follow\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"verified\":\"yes\",\"linktree\":\"https:\\/\\/linktr.ee\\/LASMID\",\"hometown\":\"\",\"fb_id\":\"\",\"video_ads\":\"yes\",\"status\":\"active\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/lasmidofficial1\\/5d071ce38d.webp\",\"name\":\"Lasmid\",\"label\":\"N.E RECORDS \\/ Dvpper Music\",\"bio\":\"Injecting a fresh, melodic energy into the Ghanaian highlife and Afro-fusion scenes from Takoradi, Western Region, singer, rapper, and songwriter Lasmid (Ladsmid Nathaniel Owusu) has risen to become one of West Africa's most compelling new-school hitmakers. Originally performing under the moniker Charger, he stepped into the national spotlight in 2019 after delivering a sensational, high-energy run to win the eighth season of the prestigious MTN Hitmaker reality competition. He subsequently signed with Kaywa's Highly Spiritual Music and achieved an explosive mainstream breakthrough with his 2022 chart-topping single \\\"Friday Night,\\\" which became a massive viral TikTok phenomenon across the continent. Celebrated for his distinct Fante-infused lyricism and seamless blending of hip-hop cadences with infectious Afrobeats rhythms, he captured wider international appeal with his show-stopping feature on JZyNo\\u2019s multi-platinum smash \\\"Butta My Bread\\\" (2023) and his collaborative project Sweet Songs 4 You (2025). He firmly solidified his elite chart prominence by dominating the airwaves with a relentless string of hit singles, including \\\"No Issues\\\" and \\\"Imaginary Mind,\\\" as well as the massively popular \\\"Signature\\\" and the star-studded Asakaa drill collaboration \\\"Julie.\\\"\",\"tiktok\":\"http:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/@lasmidofficial1\",\"facebook_name\":\"\",\"label_name\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"Lasmidofficial\",\"follow_download\":\"no\",\"suspension_whitelist\":\"\",\"twitter_id\":\"1679831666594816011\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/lasmidofficial1\\/646fdc6ef1.webp\",\"label_owner\":true,\"comment_banned\":false,\"subscription_active\":false,\"followers_count\":1882376,\"following_count\":0,\"can_upload\":true,\"type\":\"artist\",\"stats\":{\"pageviews\":\"0\",\"plays-raw\":264417787,\"plays\":\"264M\",\"downloads-raw\":0,\"downloads\":\"0\",\"embedviews\":\"0\",\"track_dls\":\"0\",\"cache-hit\":1,\"rankings\":{\"daily\":\"N\\/A\",\"weekly\":\"N\\/A\",\"monthly\":\"N\\/A\",\"yearly\":\"N\\/A\",\"total\":\"N\\/A\"}},\"images\":{\"original\":{\"filename\":\"https:\\/